@startuml
title Verification and Acceptance Ladder
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor #0F172A
  BorderColor #334155
  RoundCorner 12
}
rectangle "Write TLA+ state machine\nand shared kernel" as Model #93C5FD
rectangle "Prove nonrecursive kernel\nwith TLAPS" as Proof #A5B4FC
rectangle "Exhaust every bounded input\nand reachable TLC state" as Exhaust #60A5FA
rectangle "Counterexample?" as Counterexample #FDE68A
rectangle "Correct the specification\nwithout weakening obligations" as Correct #FCA5A5
rectangle "Extract every invariant into\nthe refinement registry" as Registry #C4B5FD
rectangle "Add exhaustive, property,\nmetamorphic, and small-stack tests" as Tests #F9A8D4
rectangle "Observe the test-only baseline\nfail for missing production behavior" as Red #FED7AA
rectangle "Implement iterative,\noptimized production machines" as Implement #86EFAC
rectangle "Run correctness, stack,\ncomplexity, and lifecycle gates" as Correctness #6EE7B7
rectangle "Run preregistered performance\nand allocation gates" as Performance #FCD34D
rectangle "Lint documentation, render diagrams,\nand pass the pgmcp bug gate" as Acceptance #2DD4BF

Model -[#2563EB]-> Proof
Proof -[#4F46E5]-> Exhaust
Exhaust -[#D97706]-> Counterexample
Counterexample -[#DC2626]-> Correct : yes
Correct -[#DC2626]-> Model : revise and rerun
Counterexample -[#7C3AED]-> Registry : no
Registry -[#BE185D]-> Tests
Tests -[#EA580C]-> Red
Red -[#16A34A]-> Implement
Implement -[#0F766E]-> Correctness
Correctness -[#D97706]-> Performance
Performance -[#0F766E]-> Acceptance
@enduml
